<view class="page"><view class="title">我的订单</view><view class="sub">按本购买，每本含 2 次单页重画。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{!orders.length}}" class="empty">还没有付费订单。</view><view wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id" class="order"><view class="row"><text>{{item.count}} 页成长小书</text><text>¥{{item.price}}</text></view><view class="small">{{item.label}}</view><view class="tiny">{{item.id}}</view><view class="actions" wx:if="{{item.status === 'created'}}"><button class="secondary" bindtap="check" data-id="{{item.id}}">核对付款</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="pay" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">继续付款</button></view><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'paid'}}" class="text-button" bindtap="open" data-id="{{item.bookId}}">打开小书 ›</button></view><view class="notice">付款后未完成的小书，可回到书架继续。<br/>如需处理未交付订单或退款，请联系客服，提供订单号。</view><button class="secondary" open-type="contact">联系叽咕</button></view>